data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt_1_7f3272d5-d286-4859-9448-7a70ef5b4ee0","delta":" email requires a connected Gmail account, and yours isn't connected yet. You'll"}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt_1_7f3272d5-d286-4859-9448-7a70ef5b4ee0","delta":" need to connect Gmail first using the card that appeared above, then I can send your"}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt_1_7f3272d5-d286-4859-9448-7a70ef5b4ee0","delta":" checking balance right to your inbox."}

